<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">一个账号 · 双端相通</view><view class="title">我的</view><view class="muted">网页端与小程序使用同一账号读取已保存行程、草稿与三类订单。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!account}}" class="auth-card"><view class="switch"><button class="{{mode === 'login' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="login" bindtap="setMode">登录</button><button class="{{mode === 'register' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="register" bindtap="setMode">注册</button></view><view class="field"><text>用户名</text><input value="{{username}}" data-field="username" bindinput="input"/></view><view wx:if="{{mode === 'register'}}" class="field"><text>昵称</text><input value="{{nickname}}" data-field="nickname" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="field"><text>密码</text><input password value="{{password}}" data-field="password" bindinput="input"/></view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="authenticate">{{mode === 'login' ? '登录我的乌东' : '创建平台账号'}}</button><button class="ghost" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="restore">恢复登录</button><view class="muted">不会保存密码；登录信息仅用于在本机继续使用当前账号。</view></view>
  <block wx:else><view class="account-card"><view class="eyebrow">已登录</view><view class="card-title">{{account.nickname}}</view><view class="muted">@{{account.username}}</view><view class="actions"><button class="ghost" bindtap="restore">更新登录</button><button class="ghost" bindtap="loadWorkspace">刷新内容</button><button class="ghost" bindtap="signOut">退出</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{summary}}" class="grid"><view class="summary" bindtap="toOrders"><text>{{summary.orderCount}}</text><view>三类订单</view></view><view class="summary"><text>{{summary.draftCount}}</text><view>食宿草稿</view></view><view class="summary"><text>{{summary.itineraryCount}}</text><view>已保存行程</view></view><view class="summary"><text>{{summary.legacyCount}}</text><view>历史记录</view></view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="toOrders">查看订单、草稿与行程</button></block><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="message">{{message}}</view></view>
